  "description": "BLS12-381 pairing-friendly elliptic curve library for .NET 8. Implements Fp, Fp2, Fp6, Fp12 tower arithmetic, G1/G2 curve operations, optimal Ate pairing, and RFC 9380 hash-to-curve. Field arithmetic is fully unrolled with no heap allocation. Constant-time scalar multiplication via Montgomery ladder. Not security-audited — use in production at your own risk.",
